WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.620
This anti-cancer drug is built
around a single platinum ion.

2
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:09.720
Around the platinum: two ammonia
molecules and two chloride ions.

3
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:13.340
But that formula belongs to
two different compounds.

4
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.300
Give a patient one,
and it fights the cancer.

5
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.980
The other is far less effective.

6
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.960
So why does only one of them treat cancer?

7
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:27.580
In this mission, you'll meet metal ions that
hold several molecules or ions around them,

8
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.460
each bonded to the metal.

9
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.320
Then you'll follow the drug inside a cell,

10
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.640
where platinum bonds to DNA
and stops the cell dividing.

11
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:41.400
Your mission: explain why only one
of the two compounds treats cancer.